@startuml Global_IJCSA_Algorithm

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam participantPadding 100
skinparam wrapWidth 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 500

participant "Master/\nOrchestrator" as Master
participant "SU₁" as SU1
participant "SU₂" as SU2
participant "SU₃" as SU3

== Global IJCSA: One Co-Simulation Step t → t+dt ==

Master -> Master: Collect ALL interface inputs U from zero-delay connections

Master -> Master: Initialize U^(0) from current input values

note over Master: **Phase 1: Global Interface-Newton (dt=0)**

loop until convergence (m = 0, 1, 2, ...)

    note over Master: **1. Evaluate all components with frozen states (dt=0)**
    
    par Parallel Execution
        Master -> SU1: evaluate_outputs(U1^(m),t)
        activate SU1
        SU1 -> SU1: Y1^(m+1) = S1(U1^(m))
        SU1 --> Master: Y1^(m+1)
        deactivate SU1
    else
        Master -> SU2: evaluate_outputs(U2^(m),t)
        activate SU2
        SU2 -> SU2: Y2^(m+1) = S2(U2^(m))
        SU2 --> Master: Y2^(m+1)
        deactivate SU2
    else
        Master -> SU3: evaluate_outputs(U3^(m),t)
        activate SU3
        SU3 -> SU3: Y3^(m+1) = S3(U3^(m))
        SU3 --> Master: Y3^(m+1)
        deactivate SU3
    end
    
    note over Master: **2. Compute global residual**
    
    Master -> Master: R^(m) = [U1^(m)-Y_driver1^(m+1)]            [U2^(m)-Y_driver2^(m+1)]            [U3^(m)-Y_driver3^(m+1)]
    
    note over Master: **3. Check convergence**
    
    alt ||R^(m)|| < tolerance
        note over Master: ✓ Converged
        Master -> Master: Exit iteration
    end
    
    note over Master: **4. Compute global Jacobian**
    
    Master -> Master: J^(m) = dR/dU\nvia finite differences
    note right
      Perturb each U_j,
      evaluate all outputs,
      compute J[:, j]
    end note
    
    note over Master: **5. Solve for correction**
    
    Master -> Master: J^(m) · ΔU^(m) = -R^(m)
    
    note over Master: **6. Apply correction**
    
    Master -> Master: U^(m+1)=U^(m)+ΔU^(m)

end

note over Master: **Phase 2: Time Integration with consistent interface**

Master -> SU1: set_inputs(U1*, t)
activate SU1
SU1 --> Master: committed
deactivate SU1

Master -> SU2: set_inputs(U2*, t)
activate SU2
SU2 --> Master: committed
deactivate SU2

Master -> SU3: set_inputs(U3*, t)
activate SU3
SU3 --> Master: committed
deactivate SU3

note over Master: **All components advance time**

par Parallel Time Integration
    Master -> SU1: do_step(t, dt)
    activate SU1
    SU1 -> SU1: Integrate t → t+dt
    SU1 --> Master: Y1(t+dt)
    deactivate SU1
else
    Master -> SU2: do_step(t, dt)
    activate SU2
    SU2 -> SU2: Integrate t → t+dt
    SU2 --> Master: Y2(t+dt)
    deactivate SU2
else
    Master -> SU3: do_step(t, dt)
    activate SU3
    SU3 -> SU3: Integrate t → t+dt
    SU3 --> Master: Y3(t+dt)
    deactivate SU3
end

Master -> Master: All components at t+dt\nReady for next step

@enduml